  skos:example "RG II 04939: Johannes Stalberch bac. in decr. vic. ad alt. s. Silvestri in eccl. s. Marie Halberstad.: m. conf. thesaur. Halberstad. sup. qua litig. contra Johannem de Hartesrode can. Halberstad. intrusum in vicedominatum d. eccl. […]"@la ,
  "RG II 09176: Johannes Prentout can. eccl. s. Crucis Leod. prov. de vicedominatu in eccl. Magdeburg. vac. p. prom. Walteri el. Merseburg. 21 mart. 1407 L 132 45."@la .


