  "RG V 00309: Andreas Radel presb. Salzeburg. dioc. de benef. (de novo fund. ) in capel. b. Marie in Lebaren e.m. op. Hartperg Salzeburg. dioc. (6 m. arg. ) vac. ex eo quod rectori par. eccl. d. op. nemo infra temp. present. fuit 24. ian. 1434 S 292 216vs."@la .


:Eheliche_Geburt_Mangel a owl:Class ;
